{
  "id": "solutions__molarity_and_dilution",
  "title": "Solutions, Molarity and Dilution",
  "description": "Calculator for molarity, dilution, and solution concentration calculations. Includes tools for calculating molarity, dilution equations, and concentration percentages.",
  "type": "calculator-table",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "## Molarity Calculator\n\nMolarity expresses the molar concentration of a compound in a solution:\n\n**M = n / V**\n\nWhere:\n- n = number of moles of solute (mol)\n- M = Molarity of the solution (mol/L)\n- V = volume of the solution (L)",
      "headers": []
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "moles_solute",
          "label": "Moles of Solute",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 1,
          "unit": "mol"
        },
        {
          "id": "volume_solution",
          "label": "Volume of Solution",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 1,
          "unit": "L"
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "molarity",
          "label": "Molarity",
          "formula": "inputs.moles_solute / inputs.volume_solution",
          "unit": "mol/L",
          "format": "decimal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "## Dilution Calculator\n\nDilution is the process where a solution is added more solvent to decrease the concentration of the solute.\n\nIn dilution, the number of moles remains constant:\n\n**Mi × Vi = Mf × Vf**\n\nWhere:\n- Mi = Initial molarity (mol/L)\n- Vi = Initial volume (L)\n- Mf = Final molarity (mol/L)\n- Vf = Final volume (L)",
      "headers": []
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "initial_molarity",
          "label": "Initial Molarity",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 1,
          "unit": "mol/L"
        },
        {
          "id": "initial_volume",
          "label": "Initial Volume",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 0.03,
          "unit": "L"
        },
        {
          "id": "final_molarity",
          "label": "Final Molarity",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 0.3,
          "unit": "mol/L"
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "final_volume",
          "label": "Final Volume Required",
          "formula": "inputs.initial_molarity * inputs.initial_volume / inputs.final_molarity",
          "unit": "L",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "moles_conserved",
          "label": "Moles (Check)",
          "formula": "inputs.initial_molarity * inputs.initial_volume",
          "unit": "mol",
          "format": "decimal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "## Weight Percentage Calculator\n\nThe mass of solute expressed as a percentage of the mass of the whole solution:\n\n**wt% = (mass of solute / total mass of solution) × 100%**",
      "headers": []
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "mass_solute",
          "label": "Mass of Solute",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 56,
          "unit": "g"
        },
        {
          "id": "mass_solvent",
          "label": "Mass of Solvent",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 800,
          "unit": "g"
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "weight_percentage",
          "label": "Weight Percentage",
          "formula": "(inputs.mass_solute / (inputs.mass_solute + inputs.mass_solvent)) * 100",
          "unit": "%",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "total_mass",
          "label": "Total Mass",
          "formula": "inputs.mass_solute + inputs.mass_solvent",
          "unit": "g",
          "format": "decimal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "## Moles from Mass Calculator\n\nCalculate the number of moles from the mass and molar weight:\n\n**n = m / M**\n\nWhere:\n- n = number of moles (mol)\n- m = mass (g)\n- M = molar weight (g/mol)",
      "headers": []
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "mass_grams",
          "label": "Mass of Substance",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 200,
          "unit": "g"
        },
        {
          "id": "molar_weight",
          "label": "Molar Weight",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 58.44,
          "unit": "g/mol"
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "number_of_moles",
          "label": "Number of Moles",
          "formula": "inputs.mass_grams / inputs.molar_weight",
          "unit": "mol",
          "format": "decimal"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}